---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
description: Receipts, Please. helps you save receipts, understand spending, and track prices over time. A smarter home for your receipts.
structuredData: true
screenshots:
  - file: scan.svg
    title: Scan in seconds
    text: Snap a receipt and the store, items, and prices are pulled out for you.
  - file: spending.svg
    title: See your spending
    text: Explore trends by store, category, and individual item.
  - file: prices.svg
    title: Follow prices
    text: Look back at what you paid and spot how prices change.
faq:
  - q: When will Receipts, Please. be available?
    a: Receipts, Please. is coming soon to Android on Google Play. <a href="#notify">Ask to be notified</a> and we’ll let you know when it launches.
  - q: How much does it cost?
    a: Receipts, Please. may offer free trials and paid subscriptions. Prices, billing periods, and trial eligibility are shown in the app before you subscribe, and subscriptions are billed and managed through Google Play.
  - q: Where are my receipts stored?
    a: Your saved purchase history is stored on your device. Cloud Sync and receipt photo backup are optional, and you choose each one separately. When you scan, the receipt image is sent securely for AI processing so the details can be extracted.
  - q: Do you sell my data?
    a: No. We don’t sell your personal information or use your receipts for advertising. <a href="/privacy/">Read our Privacy Policy</a>.
  - q: What if a scan gets something wrong?
    a: AI scanning is fast but not perfect, so you can review and edit any purchase. We recommend keeping original receipts you need for returns, warranties, or taxes.
  - q: Can I take my records with me?
    a: Yes. You can export your saved records, even if your subscription ends.
  - q: How do I delete my account?
    a: You can delete it in the app under Settings, or <a href="/delete-account/">request deletion by email</a> without reinstalling the app.
---
<main id="main">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">{% if site.playStoreUrl %}Now on Google Play{% else %}Coming soon to Android{% endif %}</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">Keep the information, not the clutter.</h1>
        <p class="tagline">{{ site.name }} is a smarter home for your receipts.</p>
        <p class="hero-description">Scan receipts to organize your purchases, understand your spending, and follow the prices of the things you buy over time.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          {%- if site.playStoreUrl %}
          <a class="store-button" href="{{ site.playStoreUrl }}">
            {% include "partials/play-icon.njk" %}
            <span><small>Get it on</small>Google Play</span>
          </a>
          {%- else %}
          <div class="store-button">
            {% include "partials/play-icon.njk" %}
            <span>Google Play<small>Coming Soon</small></span>
          </div>
          <a class="text-link" href="#notify">Get notified at launch</a>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art">
        <img src="/assets/mascot.png" width="627" height="627" alt="The {{ site.name }} smiling receipt mascot" fetchpriority="high">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features-section" aria-labelledby="features-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Simple by design</p>
        <h2 id="features-title">Make more of every receipt.</h2>
        <p>Keep the details that matter close at hand and find useful patterns in what you buy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 4H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4m18-6h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4M4 22v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4m18-6v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4"/><rect x="10" y="9" width="12" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M13 14h6m-6 4h6"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Save Receipts</h3>
          <p>Scan and keep your purchase details together, ready when you need them.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 27h22"/><rect x="7" y="17" width="4" height="10" rx="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><rect x="14" y="11" width="4" height="16" rx="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><rect x="21" y="5" width="4" height="22" rx="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Understand Spending</h3>
          <p>See where your money goes with a clearer view of your everyday purchases.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h15l9 9-12 12L4 16z"/><circle cx="11" cy="13" r="2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Track Prices</h3>
          <p>Look back at item prices over time and spot how they change.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="screens-section" aria-labelledby="screens-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">A look inside</p>
        <h2 id="screens-title">Your receipts, finally useful.</h2>
        <p>From a crumpled slip of paper to a clear picture of where your money goes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="screen-grid">
        {%- for shot in screenshots %}
        <figure class="screen">
          <div class="phone"><img src="/assets/screenshots/{{ shot.file }}" width="360" height="780" alt="{{ shot.title }} screen (preview image coming soon)" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <figcaption><strong>{{ shot.title }}</strong>{{ shot.text }}</figcaption>
        </figure>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div class="container faq-layout">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p>
        <h2 id="faq-title">Questions, answered.</h2>
        <p>Something else on your mind? Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        {%- for item in faq %}
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>{{ item.q }}</summary>
          <p>{{ item.a | safe }}</p>
        </details>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- if not site.playStoreUrl %}
  <section class="notify-section" id="notify" aria-labelledby="notify-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="notify-card">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Be first in line</p>
          <h2 id="notify-title">Get a heads-up at launch.</h2>
          <p>We’ll send one email when {{ site.name }} arrives on Google Play. No newsletters, no spam.</p>
        </div>
        {%- if site.waitlistEndpoint %}
        <form class="notify-form" action="{{ site.waitlistEndpoint }}" method="post">
          <label for="notify-email">Email address</label>
          <div class="notify-row">
            <input id="notify-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
            <button type="submit">Notify me</button>
          </div>
          <input class="visually-hidden" type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="fine-print">We’ll only use your email for the launch notice. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        </form>
        {%- else %}
        <div class="notify-form">
          <a class="action-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Notify%20me%20when%20Receipts%2C%20Please.%20launches"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m3 6 9 7 9-7"/></svg>Email me at launch</a>
          <p class="fine-print">Opens your email app with the message ready to send. We’ll only use your email for the launch notice. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        </div>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endif %}
</main>
